## 7. Re-Audit Closure (2026-02-09)

### Verified and Closed
- `server/scout/scoutService.ts` exists and is wired by:
  - `server/routes/adminScout.ts`
  - `server/routes/partnerPortal.ts`
- `server/cron/evaluateChallenges.ts` exists and is initialized from:
  - `server/index.ts`
- Partner portal frontend verified and enhanced:
  - `client/src/pages/PartnerPortal.tsx`
  - Added `Simulations` tab, password reminder modal, and onboarding gate UX.
- Scout partner management frontend verified and enhanced:
  - `client/src/components/admin/ScoutWorkbench.tsx`
  - Added per-partner gate override editor wired to `/api/admin/partners/:id/gating-overrides`.

### Security/Transport/E2EE Deep Check
- HTTPS enforced for production partner API traffic:
  - `server/middleware/requirePartner.ts`
- Partner inquiry E2EE envelope + recipient mailbox key checks enforced:
  - `server/routes/partnerPortal.ts`
  - `server/partner/inquiryRouting.ts`

### Retest Evidence
- Typecheck: `./node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit` passed.
- Build: Vite + server bundle passed.
- E2E:
  - `e2e/partner-onboarding.spec.ts` passed.
  - `e2e/scout-ecosystem.spec.ts` passed.

### Remaining Gaps
- None identified in this scoped recruitment/partner onboarding implementation after the 7-cycle audit/fix/retest loop.
